      "effect_text": {
        "en": {
          "plain": "You may only cast this card if you have three or more monsters on your field.\n[Cn/Turn] [Counter] Choose one of the following.\n• Put a card other than \"A Ruler's Privilege \"Re:S\"\" from your drop zone into your hand.\n• [Stand] all cards on your field.\n• Nullify the attack. Then, if your opponent's cards attacked three times or more during this turn, and a monster with \"Geargod\" in its card name is on your field, end this phase.",
